        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "stack",
        "spacing": "normal",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "section",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Why is this a problem?"
              }
            ],
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "spacing": "compact",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I interviewed online shoppers to understand how they choose sizes, where they encounter uncertainty, and what helps them decide whether to buy."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Five participants described their shopping routines and how they handle inconsistent sizing. Their feedback informed a concept that combines measurements with personal fit preferences. Key interview insights included:"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "columns",
            "spacing": "normal",
            "ratios": [
              100,
              97,
              100,
              100
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "card",
                "variant": "quote",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "richText",
                    "role": "body",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "\"It's important for the online store to have a "
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "highlight",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "good return policy"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": ", and it played a factor in whether they were willing to purchase from the store.\""
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "card",
                "variant": "quote",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "richText",
                    "role": "body",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "\"Sizes are "
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "highlight",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "inconsistent"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": " more between brand than within brands but fabric stretch can make sizes within brands inconsistent\""
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "card",
                "variant": "quote",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "richText",
                    "role": "body",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "span",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "\" "
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "highlight",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Reviews and images "
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "play a large part in how I determine my size online.\""
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "card",
                "variant": "quote",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "richText",
                    "role": "body",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "\" If I am in between 2 sizes, I will decide if I prefer a "
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "highlight",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "looser"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "highlight",
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": " or tighter fit "
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "and then choose my size according to that.\""
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "stack",
        "spacing": "normal",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "section",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Current Solutions "
              }
            ],
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "spacing": "compact",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Similar problem spaces have been addressed by other products. Market solutions typically include retail site plugins with quizzes for size estimation. These approaches fall short due to subjective measurements and limited user awareness. However, TrueFit presents an innovative solution by estimating sizes based on brands the user already knows, thus incorporating the user's personal knowledge for more accurate sizing."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "richText",
                "role": "body",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "One gap in the market is a product that recommends clothing based on the user's size and preferences, rather than the user having to search for items that fit. This approach ensures that users won't encounter the frustration of finding something they like only to discover it's not available in their size."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "columns",
        "spacing": "small",
        "ratios": [
          100,
          100,
          100,
          100,
          100,
          100
        ],
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Allows users to save data"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sizing based off familiar brands"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Visibility"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Objective Sizing Accuracy"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "richText",
            "role": "body",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Retail Site Integration"
              }
            ]
          },
